umans-evolution-science]; The jewelry was crafted by Neanderthals [SUPPORTED: https://www.nationalgeographic.com/science/article/neanderthals-cave-art-humans-evolution-science]; The pigments are dated to 115,000 years old [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cave_of_Los_Aviones]; The finds (shell beads and pigments) are at least 115,000 years old [SUPPORTED: https://www.nationalgeographic.com/science/article/neanderthals-cave-art-humans-evolution-science]"}]'::jsonb),
