edia.org/wiki/Dun_Ardtreck]; The later finds at Dun Ardtreck include iron tools. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dun_Ardtreck]; The later finds at Dun Ardtreck include bronze ornaments. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dun_Ardtreck]; The later finds at Dun Ardtreck include sherds of Roman Samian ware. [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dun_Ardtreck]"}]'::jsonb),
