ediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-02/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "At least seven Neanderthals were found at La Ferrassie, all in a 60 cm layer dated to 74-68 thousand years ago. Its Mousterian burial structures provided evidence of Neanderthal burial."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-02: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-02-check-v-001 (check-v), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-02/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "at least seven Neanderthals were found at La Ferrassie [S5]; all were found in a 60 cm layer [S6]; the layer is dated to 74-68 thousand years ago [S6]; Mousterian burial structures were found at the site [S4]; they provided evidence of Neanderthal burial [S4]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-02: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-02-verify2-003 (verify2), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-02/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "La Ferrassie is an archaeological site (cave and rock shelters) in France [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Ferrassie]; At least seven Neanderthals were found there [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Ferrassie]; The site is in France [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Ferrassie]; All were in a 60 cm layer [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Ferrassie]; The layer is dated to 74-68 thousand years ago [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Ferrassie]; It has Mousterian burial structures [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Ferrassie]; Its Mousterian burial structures provided evidence of Neanderthal burial [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Ferrassie]"}]'::jsonb),
